  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* Automatically build exe on release by @ly4k in https://github.com/ly4k/Certipy/pull/301\r\n* Support Outflank C2 reg query command by @JJK96 in https://github.com/ly4k/Certipy/pull/306\r\n* Allow -debug flags from anywhere by @VeryDampTowel in https://github.com/ly4k/Certipy/pull/321\r\n* Fix Shadow Credential certification validation by @laxa in https://github.com/ly4k/Certipy/pull/322\r\n* Allow resolving and obtaining SIDs using bloodhound by @JJK96 in https://github.com/ly4k/Certipy/pull/307\r\n* Fix ESC1 false negatives in template enumeration by @vilacham in https://github.com/ly4k/Certipy/pull/317\r\n* Compatibility with impacket 0.13.0 by @exploide in https://github.com/ly4k/Certipy/pull/333\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @JJK96 made their first contribution in https://github.com/ly4k/Certipy/pull/306\r\n* @VeryDampTowel made their first contribution in https://github.com/ly4k/Certipy/pull/321\r\n* @laxa made their first contribution in https://github.com/ly4k/Certipy/pull/322\r\n* @vilacham made their first contribution in https://github.com/ly4k/Certipy/pull/317\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ly4k/Certipy/compare/5.0.3...5.0.4",
